publish	Build and publish both architectures	2026-10-21T07:39:11.3336477Z               "id": "645f15ee63ff1b18cb6ed6f19b138509ea5271a2",
publish	Build and publish both architectures	2026-10-21T07:39:11.3338582Z               "message": "Add OpenID Connect sign-in\n\nAdd opt-in generic OIDC discovery and authorization-code sign-in with S256 PKCE, signed state cookies and nonce verification. Only a verified provider email can link to an existing account; auto-creation remains an explicit deployment choice.\n\nStore provider subjects with one-to-one user links, issue the normal secure session after callback, expose only the provider label on the public sign-in page, and document callback/compose configuration. Cover a real PostgreSQL flow against a local signed-JWT identity provider.",
